@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@token = {{token}}

### Listar feriados
GET {{baseUrl}}/holidays
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar feriado recorrente (Natal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/holidays
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Natal",
  "recurring": true,
  "month": 12,
  "day": 25
}

### Criar feriado de data completa (Carnaval, móvel)
POST {{baseUrl}}/holidays
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carnaval",
  "recurring": false,
  "year": 2027,
  "month": 2,
  "day": 16
}

### Atualizar feriado
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/holidays/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Natal (atualizado)"
}

### Remover feriado
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/holidays/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
